<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Attribution classifiers</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Attribution classifiers are trained to probe internal model
representations. Hyperparameters for <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Layer-LR</span> and <span id="A1.SS2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Layer-MLP</span> were selected via grid search over dropout <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math>
(<math id="A1.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{0,0.1,0.2\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{0,0.1,0.2\}</annotation></semantics></math>), weight decay <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>λ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda</annotation></semantics></math>
(<math id="A1.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\{0,5\!\times\!10^{-4},10^{-3},2\!\times\!10^{-3}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mpadded style="width:0.108em;" width="0.108em"><mo>,</mo></mpadded><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mpadded style="width:0.108em;" width="0.108em"><mo>,</mo></mpadded><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{0,5\!\times\!10^{-4},10^{-3},2\!\times\!10^{-3}\}</annotation></semantics></math>), learning rate <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math>
(<math id="A1.SS2.p1.m6" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\{5\!\times\!10^{-4},10^{-3},2\!\times\!10^{-3}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mpadded style="width:0.108em;" width="0.108em"><mo>,</mo></mpadded><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{5\!\times\!10^{-4},10^{-3},2\!\times\!10^{-3}\}</annotation></semantics></math>), and (for Layer-MLP) bottleneck size <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math>
(<math id="A1.SS2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{64,128\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>64,128</mn><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{64,128\}</annotation></semantics></math>), using a title-aware 15% validation split.
Models were trained for 10 epochs; the selected configuration maximises validation macro-<math id="A1.SS2.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="F_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">F_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> with early-stopping
(tie-breaker: validation accuracy). Selected values are reported below.</p>
</div>
