<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Additional Results</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section reports additional experimental results that support the
main findings in the paper, including ablation studies and
out-of-domain generalisation performance.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T10" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T10.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T10.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T10.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt"><span id="A2.T10.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Classifier</span></th>
<th id="A2.T10.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A2.T10.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Accuracy</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A2.T10.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T10.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">Layer-agg LogReg</th>
<td id="A2.T10.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">0.724</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T10.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T10.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">Layer-agg MLP</th>
<td id="A2.T10.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">0.541</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 10: </span>Answer-string decoy ablation on SQuAD using Llama-3.1-8B.
While performance drops for all classifiers, the linear probe remains
well above chance, whereas the MLP collapses to near-random accuracy,
indicating reliance on entity repetition.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.F4" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.22787v1/img/layer_pca_Llama-3.1-8B_first_token_generation_layers1to32_wrap4.png" id="A2.F4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:357/706;" width="357" height="706" alt="Refer to caption">
