</figure>
<figure id="A2.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.22787v1/img/layer_pca_Mistral-7B-v0.1_first_token_generation_layers1to32_wrap4.png" id="A2.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:357/706;" width="357" height="706" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>Per-layer PCA of hidden states for Mistral-7B-v0.1.</figcaption>
</figure>
